  m_text: 'Every boss has two important stats: Health (HP) and Attack (ATK).

    Health
    (HP) determines how much damage the boss can take before being defeated.

    Attack
    (ATK) determines how much damage the boss deals when it attacks.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
